{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>街頭偶然聽到一段動人旋律、在咖啡店被背景音樂吸引，或於朋友聚會上聽到一首想立即加入歌單的新歌，卻始終想不起歌名？《SongDetect》正是為這些時刻而設，適合所有喜愛音樂、不想再錯過好歌的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-115.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一鍵辨識秒速找回歌曲</h2>\n<p>開啟 App 後按下畫面中央的大按鈕，即可在約 3 秒內辨識身邊播放的歌曲，流行金曲、經典舊歌或小眾獨立音樂都能精準配對。辨識成功後可即時播放，重溫當下感覺，亦可把歌曲存入個人播放清單，日後隨時回味。App 會自動記錄所有辨識歷史，即使當時匆忙也能輕鬆找回。介面沿用 Apple Music 風格，動畫流暢，更可一鍵跳轉至 Apple Music 探索相關歌曲與專輯。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-560-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-561-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-562-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-563-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-564-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SongDetect – Music Recognition</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/songdetect-music-recognition/id6753138898?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:01:29.384478+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:37:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T21:58:46.207184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:58:43.688523+00:00","content_hash":"8bd5b8cf47bfcf227a067edf42ef0b0c7e1329aeba93265d76c73e279a8ab2c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}